Created: 2025-10-11
Version: 1.0
#}
REQUIRED DATA FOR BOOKING:
- Customer's full name
- Contact email
- Phone number
- Service type
- Date (YYYY-MM-DD)
- Time (HH:MM in 24-hour format)
- Duration (optional, depends on service)
